DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T190000
DTSTAMP:20260826T135603Z
UID:smcl-6a848991be148200298825bf@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Held on the first open Monday of every month\, each Teen Hango
 ut session  features a new theme with art projects\, music\, snacks\, and 
 casual social time. This month get your planner or journal ready for the s
 chool year by using some of our washi tape\, stickers\, pens and more. Use
  this time to prepare and reflect for the coming year\, make memories with
  friends or just add a bit of joy to your planning spaces. No registration
  required\, as supplies last.\n\nAges: 12-18\nRegistration: none\nSource: 
 https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a848991be148200298825bf\nLast synce
 d: 2026-08-26 06:56 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a848991be148200298825bf
END:VEVENT
