SUMMARY:[ATH] Reading Buddies Club: Llama Piñata Fiesta!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T170000
DTSTAMP:20260826T135603Z
UID:smcl-6a8cc70129a7dd0d67465219@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a casual and fun kids' reading club\, where you ca
 n bring the books to us! We'll focus on a new theme each month\, with game
 s\, crafts\, and of course lots of extra books for you to explore and prac
 tice reading at your own pace in a supportive environment. Whether you're 
 a seasoned bookworm or just starting to explore new stories\, all are welc
 ome to join! \n\nThis month\, we'll be celebrating Latinx Heritage Month! 
 Join us for a variety of themed activities and make our own mini llama pi
 ñatas. Bring your favorite book from home that makes you think of this mo
 nth's theme\, share your favorite parts with your fellow reading club frie
 nds\, and earn your Reading Buddies Badge! No registration required\, as s
 upplies last for the craft.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: htt
 ps://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a8cc70129a7dd0d67465219\nLast synced: 
 2026-08-26 06:56 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a8cc70129a7dd0d67465219
