DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260902T193000
DTSTAMP:20260826T135603Z
UID:littlegreen-lg-calligraphy-class-with-inja-inks-20260902@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Calligraphy Class with Inja Inks Relax your mind and focus on 
 learning a new craft! Experiment with letters using dip pens and colored i
 nks\, make marks based on letterforms and take home a pamphlet stitched bo
 oklet of your practice pages! Make art from your own handwriting! Calligra
 phy is a great meditative way to clear the mind and focus on one thing! Se
 ptember 2nd 6pm-7:30pm\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.littlegreena
 plantbar.com/classes\nLast synced: 2026-08-26 06:56 PDT
LOCATION:Little Green a Plant Bar\, 1101 Main St\, Redwood City\, CA 94063
URL:https://www.littlegreenaplantbar.com/classes
END:VEVENT
