DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T193000
DTSTAMP:20260826T135603Z
UID:littlegreen-lg-ghost-needle-felting-20260917@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Ghost Needle Felting These little friends have been haunting o
 ur space since we opened! Learn the art of needle felting and make your ow
 n! You can make them hold whatever your imagination can come up with\, tho
 ugh you’ll often see ours holding pumpkins\, candy corn\, candy canes\, 
 hearts\, or carrots depending on the time of the year! September 17th 5:30
 pm-7:30pm $40\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.littlegreenaplantbar.
 com/classes\nLast synced: 2026-08-26 06:56 PDT
LOCATION:Little Green a Plant Bar\, 1101 Main St\, Redwood City\, CA 94063
