BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[RWC] Fall Mug Making
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T200000
DTSTAMP:20260826T135603Z
UID:littlegreen-lg-fall-mug-making-20260924@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Fall Mug Making Hand craft a mug with Kristen of Snaillie Girl
  Ceramics\, no pottery wheel needed! You’ll also get to take home a bag 
 of The Answer by Cat & Cloud\, the same blend of beans we use for our coff
 ee at the shop! We can grind the beans however you need on the day of the 
 class if you need that service. The mugs will be fired and ready for pick 
 up at a later date. Decaf beans are also available if you let us know earl
 y enough. Email riley@littlegreenaplantbar.com if you have coffee question
 s! September 24th 5:30pm-8:00pm\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.lit
 tlegreenaplantbar.com/classes\nLast synced: 2026-08-26 06:56 PDT
LOCATION:Little Green a Plant Bar\, 1101 Main St\, Redwood City\, CA 94063
URL:https://www.littlegreenaplantbar.com/classes
